# C094: Derived VFS can outlive an unretained APSW base
#
# CONFIRMED — static analysis (use-after-free / ownership)
#
# APSW detects whether a base is an APSW object by comparing only xAccess with
# the APSW trampoline (vfs.c:1732-1734).  A base created with exclude={"xAccess"}
# has NULL there, so the child takes no strong Python reference.  Deleting the
# base unregisters and frees its sqlite3_vfs while the child retains a dangling
# pointer.
